# Evidence raw files are bytes, not text.
#
# Each dataset directory records the sha256 of its raw/ files in
# provenance-manifest.json. A line-ending conversion on checkout silently broke
# that record once: the manifests written on 2026-10-27 hashed CRLF working
# copies (core.autocrlf=true) while the repository held LF, so every fresh
# clone failed `node scripts/audit-evidence-provenance.cjs website --strict`
# (found and fixed 2026-11-26). These paths are now byte-exact in every
# checkout; scripts/audit-evidence-provenance.cjs additionally hashes the
# committed bytes, so a stale working copy cannot bring the bug back.
website/evidence/raw/** -text
website/evidence-ds-*/raw/** -text
website/evidence-new/raw/** -text
